{"title":"Dust Mote","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Dust Devil, Sand Devil, Dust Devil</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dust-devil\" title=\"Dust Devil - Normal, 45.5% of recorded drops (15 / 33 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/f34357445edb2cc8b0c3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dust Devil</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">45.5%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sand-devil\" title=\"Sand Devil - Normal, 50.0% of recorded drops (4 / 8 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d197bb2687af7a8b0b16.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sand Devil</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50.0%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"dust-devil\" title=\"Dust Devil - Elite, 25.0% of recorded drops (1 / 4 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/f34357445edb2cc8b0c3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dust Devil</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25.0%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"dust-mote\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/1c70ff443aaceb81445a.svg\" alt=\"Dust Mote\"></div><h3>Dust Mote</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/6/2026, 7:43:40 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}